{"Marking reminder as cancelled and relying on cron job introduces regression for last-minute cancellations - if booking is cancelled after the last cron run before scheduled reminder time, SendGrid never receives cancel request and email still goes out": 0.9221832156181335, "Need to cancel immediately via SendGrid API when reminder scheduledDate is within the cron interval (15 minutes or less) instead of just setting cancelled: true, to prevent emails from being sent for last-minute cancellations": 0.8744844794273376}